@@color:red;
A style block by declaration.
@@

@@.myclass
A style block by class.
@@

@@color:red;background:yellow;.myclass
Both at once.
@@

@@color:red;an inline style run@@ after it.

@@.myclass an inline class run@@ after it.

A DECLARATION LIST CARRIES AS MANY DECLARATIONS AS AN AUTHOR WRITES, each ended by its semicolon:

@@color:green;background:red;font-weight:bold;styled@@ after it.

A class run takes its class from a `.name` standing before the content, and the host binds NO style
attribute for it: @@.a-class .a-second-class styled@@ after it.
